---
import LocalFonts from '../components/LocalFonts.astro';
import '../styles/campaign.css';
const canonical='https://futureproofagents.com/ai-for-accounting-firms/';
const title='AI & CRM Implementation for Accounting Firms | FutureProof';
const description='AI automation for U.S. accounting and CPA firms. Connect client onboarding, document collection, CRM workflows and firm knowledge. Custom projects from $5,000.';
const services=[
 ['01','Client onboarding that moves forward','Connect inquiry forms, engagement steps and client records. Give your team a clear next action when a new client arrives.','Accounting client onboarding'],
 ['02','Less document chasing','Organize incoming documents, identify missing items against an agreed checklist and prepare follow-ups for review.','Client document collection and follow-ups'],
 ['03','A CRM your team can work from','Connect client conversations, tasks and status updates across agreed systems. Make ownership and outstanding work easier to see.','CRM implementation for accounting firms'],
 ['04','Connected accounting workflows','Reduce repeated data entry between your practice tools, email and documents. Handle exceptions and route decisions to the right person.','Accounting workflow automation'],
 ['05','Your firm’s knowledge, in reach','Find relevant procedures, prior work and internal guidance with links to the source. Flag material that needs a freshness check.','AI knowledge systems for CPA firms'],
 ['06','AI agents with clear boundaries','Build custom AI agents for the steps your existing software cannot cover. Define permissions, review points and a practical handover.','AI implementation for accounting firms']
];
const process=[
 ['Map one valuable workflow','We review the bottleneck, the systems involved and the work your team repeats.','An agreed starting point'],
 ['Define scope and success','Set the integrations, access, review steps and acceptance criteria before building.','A scoped proposal, from $5,000'],
 ['Build, connect and test','Implement the workflow and test real examples, missing inputs and failure cases.','A pilot with your team'],
 ['Train and hand over','Document the process, train the people using it and agree on support and ongoing costs.','A system your firm can operate']
];
const faqs=[
 ['What can AI do for accounting firms?','AI can help organize client information, classify incoming documents, draft follow-ups and retrieve internal knowledge. We focus on a specific operational workflow and define where a person must review the output. Your team retains responsibility for accounting and tax decisions.'],
 ['Do you provide AI consulting for accountants as well as implementation?','Yes. We map the process and help choose a suitable approach, then build, integrate, test and train your team within an agreed scope. The first conversation helps establish whether a custom project is worthwhile.'],
 ['Can you work with our existing CRM or practice management software?','We start with the tools you have. During scoping, we assess systems such as TaxDome, Karbon, Canopy, Financial Cents, QuickBooks, Xero, Microsoft 365, Google Workspace and your CRM. Connections depend on API access, permissions and the capabilities of each product; we confirm feasibility before committing to an integration.'],
 ['Our software already automates reminders. What would you add?','We first check what your existing tools can already do. A project may connect work across systems, process less structured inputs, create a shared view of client activity or add a firm knowledge workflow. We scope the gaps that remain after native features are considered.'],
 ['How much does accounting automation cost?','Custom implementation projects start at $5,000 USD. The proposal defines deliverables, milestones and acceptance criteria. Hosting, software subscriptions, AI usage and ongoing support are identified separately. A timeline follows the agreed scope and access requirements.'],
 ['How do you handle sensitive client information?','We agree on access permissions, necessary data, storage and human review during scoping. We can begin testing with redacted or sample documents. Please do not submit tax returns, Social Security numbers, passwords or client records through this inquiry form.'],
 ['Do you work with U.S. CPA and bookkeeping firms?','Yes. This service is for U.S. accounting, CPA, tax and bookkeeping firms that need a custom AI or CRM implementation. Work is delivered remotely, with project meetings and handover arrangements agreed with your team.'],
 ['Do we need to replace our CRM?','Not necessarily. CRM integration and workflow improvements may solve the problem within your current setup. If migration is needed, we agree on the records, mapping, checks and cutover before work begins.']
];
const solutions=[['operations','Documents & workflows'],['sales','Client intake & CRM'],['knowledge','Firm knowledge'],['service','Client communication'],['not_sure','Help choosing a first project']];
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en" dir="ltr">
<head>
 <meta charset="UTF-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/>
 <title>{title}</title><meta name="description" content={description}/><link rel="canonical" href={canonical}/>
 <meta name="robots" content="index,follow,max-image-preview:large"/>
 <meta property="og:title" content={title}/><meta property="og:description" content={description}/><meta property="og:type" content="website"/><meta property="og:url" content={canonical}/><meta property="og:locale" content="en_US"/><meta property="og:image" content="https://futureproofagents.com/yuval-keshtcher.jpg"/>
 <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"/><meta name="twitter:title" content={title}/><meta name="twitter:description" content={description}/><meta name="twitter:image" content="https://futureproofagents.com/yuval-keshtcher.jpg"/>
 <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml"/><LocalFonts primary="inter"/>
 <script is:inline src="/scripts/analytics.js" defer></script>
 <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({'@context':'https://schema.org','@type':'Service',name:'AI and CRM implementation for accounting firms',description,serviceType:['AI consulting for accountants','Accounting workflow automation','CRM implementation for accounting firms'],provider:{'@type':'Organization',name:'FutureProof Agents',url:'https://futureproofagents.com'},areaServed:{'@type':'Country',name:'United States'},url:canonical,inLanguage:'en-US'})}/>
</head>
<body>
 <a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
 <header class="nav wrap"><a href="/" class="brand" aria-label="FutureProof Agents home"><img src="/favicon.svg" width="36" height="36" alt=""/><span>FutureProof <b>Agents</b></span></a><nav aria-label="Page navigation"><a href="#solutions">What we build</a><a href="#process">Our process</a><a class="button small" href="#start">Discuss your project <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></nav></header>
 <main id="main">
  <section class="hero wrap accounting-hero">
   <div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span>FOR U.S. ACCOUNTING & CPA FIRMS</p><h1>AI for accounting firms.<br/><em>Built into your workflow.</em></h1><p class="intro">Connect client intake, document follow-ups, CRM updates and firm knowledge. We scope and build the AI systems that help your team move client work forward.</p><a class="button" href="#start">Find your first project <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><p class="micro investment">Custom implementation from <strong>$5,000 USD</strong>.<br/>Start with a free introductory conversation.</p></div>
   <aside class="workflow-preview" aria-label="Illustrative client workflow"><div class="preview-top"><span class="eyebrow">ONE CONNECTED PROCESS</span><span class="preview-label">Example workflow</span></div><ol><li><span class="workflow-icon">01</span><div><strong>A client sends a document</strong><span>Email or an agreed client portal</span></div></li><li><span class="workflow-icon">02</span><div><strong>The next step is prepared</strong><span>Classify, match and flag missing information</span></div></li><li><span class="workflow-icon">03</span><div><strong>The client record stays current</strong><span>Update the CRM and assign the next task</span></div></li><li><span class="workflow-icon">04</span><div><strong>Your team reviews exceptions</strong><span>People approve the decisions that need judgment</span></div></li></ol><div class="preview-footer"><span class="dot"></span>Designed around your tools and approval rules.</div></aside>
  </section>
  <section class="fit-strip wrap" aria-label="Project fit"><span>Accounting, CPA & bookkeeping firms</span><span>CRM and practice software integrations</span><span>Remote delivery for U.S. teams</span></section>
  <section class="section wrap" id="solutions"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">ACCOUNTING WORKFLOW AUTOMATION</p><h2>Less work between systems.<br/>More clarity for your team.</h2></div><p>Start with the process that consumes time every week. Build a useful connection, test it with your people and expand when it works.</p></div><div class="services">{services.map(([n,heading,body,note])=><article><span class="number">{n}</span><h3>{heading}</h3><p>{body}</p><span class="service-note">{note}</span></article>)}</div></section>
  <section class="integration-section wrap"><p class="eyebrow">CRM & PRACTICE MANAGEMENT</p><h2>Start with the systems your firm already uses.</h2><p>AI automation for accounting firms starts with understanding the work. We assess your CRM, practice management software, email, documents and accounting tools, then choose the connections your project needs.</p><div class="tool-list" aria-label="Examples of systems assessed during scoping"><span>TaxDome</span><span>Karbon</span><span>Canopy</span><span>Financial Cents</span><span>QuickBooks</span><span>Xero</span><span>Microsoft 365</span><span>Google Workspace</span></div><p class="micro">These are examples to assess during scoping. Integration availability depends on each system’s access, API and plan.</p></section>
  <section class="section wrap process" id="process"><div class="process-intro"><p class="eyebrow">AI CONSULTING & IMPLEMENTATION</p><h2>One agreed workflow.<br/><em>A practical first project.</em></h2><p>You work with us from the initial process map through implementation and handover. We define what will be delivered and how your team will accept it.</p><a class="text-link" href="#start">Tell us where work gets stuck ↗</a></div><ol>{process.map(([heading,body,deliverable],i)=><li><span class="step-number">0{i+1}</span><div><h3>{heading}</h3><p>{body}</p><small>{deliverable}</small></div></li>)}</ol></section>
  <section class="founder wrap"><img src="/yuval-keshtcher.jpg" alt="Yuval Keshtcher, founder of FutureProof Agents" width="180" height="180" loading="lazy"/><div><p class="eyebrow">YOUR IMPLEMENTATION PARTNER</p><h2>Hi, I’m Yuval.</h2><p>I lead FutureProof Agents. We bring process mapping, AI development and integration into the same project, so the system fits the way your team works. Our published work spans CRM-connected research, customer service and company knowledge.</p><a class="text-link" href="/">Explore our work ↗</a></div></section>
  <section class="form-section section" id="start"><div class="wrap form-layout"><div class="form-intro"><p class="eyebrow">LET’S FIND THE RIGHT FIRST PROJECT</p><h2>Tell us about<br/><em>your firm.</em></h2><p>A few details help us understand your systems and the work you want to improve. Custom projects start at $5,000 USD.</p><div class="next"><h3>What happens next?</h3><p><span>01</span>We review your workflow, tools and project needs.</p><p><span>02</span>You can book a free introductory call after submitting.</p><p><span>03</span>If there is a fit, we agree on scope and a proposal.</p></div><p class="privacy-short">Use business contact details only. Please do not include tax returns, client records, passwords or other confidential client information.</p></div>
   <div class="form-card"><form id="lead-form" data-language="en" novalidate>
    <input type="hidden" name="form_type" value="accounting_us"/><input type="hidden" name="revenue_band" value="undisclosed"/><input type="hidden" name="revenue_currency" value="USD"/>
    <div class="form-progress" aria-label="Form progress"><span data-progress="0" aria-current="step"><b>1</b>Your project</span><span data-progress="1"><b>2</b>Your details</span></div><p class="required-note">All fields are required unless marked optional.</p>
    <div class="trap" aria-hidden="true"><label>Website<input name="website_check" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"/></label></div>
    <fieldset data-step="0"><legend>What would you like to improve?</legend>
     <label>Firm name<input name="company" required minlength="2" maxlength="160" autocomplete="organization"/></label>
     <label>Firm website (optional)<input name="firm_website" type="url" maxlength="250" placeholder="https://yourfirm.com" autocomplete="url"/></label>
     <label>What services does your firm provide?<textarea name="business_description" required minlength="5" maxlength="800" rows="2" placeholder="For example, monthly bookkeeping and tax services for small businesses."></textarea></label>
     <label>Team size<select name="team_size" required><option value="">Choose a range</option><option value="1_4">1–4 people</option><option value="5_10">5–10 people</option><option value="11_30">11–30 people</option><option value="31_100">31–100 people</option><option value="100_plus">More than 100 people</option></select></label>
     <label>Current CRM, practice software and other tools<input name="current_software" required minlength="2" maxlength="200" placeholder="For example, TaxDome, QuickBooks and Microsoft 365"/><small>Write “spreadsheets” or “not sure” if that best describes your setup.</small></label>
     <label>Project budget (USD)<select name="project_budget" required><option value="">Choose a range</option><option value="5k_10k">$5,000–$10,000</option><option value="10k_25k">$10,000–$25,000</option><option value="25k_plus">$25,000+</option><option value="scope_5k_plus">Help me scope it — I understand projects start at $5,000</option></select></label>
     <label>Where does work get stuck?<textarea name="challenge" required minlength="10" maxlength="1000" rows="3" placeholder="Describe one recurring task, handoff or information gap you want to improve."></textarea></label>
     <fieldset class="solution-group"><legend>Where can we help?</legend><small>Choose one or more.</small><div class="solution-options">{solutions.map(([value,label])=><label><input type="checkbox" name="solutions" value={value}/><span>{label}</span></label>)}</div></fieldset>
    </fieldset>
    <fieldset data-step="1" hidden><legend>Who should we speak with?</legend><label>Full name<input name="full_name" required minlength="2" maxlength="120" autocomplete="name"/></label><label>Your role<input name="job_title" required minlength="2" maxlength="120" autocomplete="organization-title" placeholder="Owner, managing partner, operations lead…"/></label><label>Work email<input name="email" type="email" required maxlength="180" autocomplete="email"/></label><label>Phone number (optional)<input name="phone" type="tel" maxlength="60" autocomplete="tel"/></label><input type="hidden" name="linkedin_url" value=""/><label class="consent"><input type="checkbox" name="consent" required/><span>I agree that FutureProof Agents may use these details to respond to my inquiry, as explained in the <a href="#inquiry-privacy">inquiry privacy notice</a>.</span></label></fieldset>
    <p id="form-error" role="alert" tabindex="-1"></p><div class="form-actions"><button type="button" data-back hidden>Back</button><span data-step-count>Step 1 of 2</span><button class="button" type="button" data-next>Continue <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button><button class="button" type="submit" data-submit hidden>Discuss my project <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button></div>
    <noscript><p>Please enable JavaScript to use this form, or <a href="https://calendar.app.google/uWpM7vrcaS4JAZTQ6">book a conversation here</a>.</p></noscript>
   </form><div id="form-success" tabindex="-1" hidden><span class="success-mark">✓</span><p class="eyebrow">YOUR INQUIRY IS IN</p><h3>Let’s discuss your first project.</h3><p>Thank you. We have received your details and will contact you at the email you provided. You can also choose a time for a free introductory call with Yuval.</p><a class="button" href="https://calendar.app.google/uWpM7vrcaS4JAZTQ6" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Book your free call ↗</a></div></div>
  </div></section>
  <section class="section wrap faq"><div><p class="eyebrow">AI FOR CPA FIRMS</p><h2>Before we talk.</h2></div><div>{faqs.map(([q,a])=><details><summary>{q}<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>{a}</p></details>)}</div></section>
  <section class="wrap privacy" id="inquiry-privacy"><details><summary>Inquiry privacy notice</summary><p>FutureProof Agents uses the business and contact details you submit to assess and respond to this inquiry. We store your submission in our private lead database and a private Google spreadsheet, and send an internal email alert with the inquiry details. We also store the page, referral source, campaign identifiers and ad-click identifiers supplied in the link to understand where inquiries come from. First and latest referral details are kept in browser session storage. A hashed network identifier helps prevent spam. Optional Google Analytics is controlled separately by your analytics preference and receives a successful-submission event without your form answers. This form does not subscribe you to a mailing list or send your contact details and project answers to an advertising platform. Contact us through our website to request access, correction or deletion of your inquiry details.</p></details></section>
 </main>
 <footer class="wrap"><a class="brand" href="/">FutureProof Agents</a><p>AI consulting, CRM integration and implementation for accounting firms.</p><a href="#start">Discuss your project ↗</a></footer>
 <script src="../scripts/campaign-form.ts"></script>
</body></html>
<style>
 .accounting-hero{grid-template-columns:1.15fr 1fr;gap:56px}.accounting-hero h1{font-size:clamp(39px,4.2vw,58px)}.investment{font-size:14px;line-height:1.9}.investment strong{color:var(--ink)}
 .workflow-preview{border:1px solid #34506a;border-radius:22px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#152638,#0b1018);padding:28px;box-shadow:0 28px 100px #1d9bf012}.preview-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:start;gap:10px}.preview-top .eyebrow{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.7px}.preview-label{font-size:10px;color:#9caebe;white-space:nowrap}.workflow-preview ol{list-style:none;margin:6px 0 22px;padding:0}.workflow-preview li{display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:start;position:relative;padding:18px 0}.workflow-preview li:not(:last-child)::after{content:'';position:absolute;width:1px;height:22px;background:#3c5670;left:19px;bottom:-10px}.workflow-icon{font:11px/40px 'JetBrains Mono',monospace;width:40px;flex:none;text-align:center;color:#8acaff;border:1px solid #3d5c76;border-radius:11px;background:#122d44}.workflow-preview strong{display:block;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;margin:2px 0 5px}.workflow-preview li div>span{display:block;color:#a7b8c8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.7}.preview-footer{border-top:1px solid #314457;padding-top:20px;font-size:11px;color:#b7c9da;line-height:1.7}.fit-strip{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:15px 32px;justify-content:space-between;border-block:1px solid var(--line);padding-block:23px;color:#b6c2cc;font-size:13px}.integration-section{border:1px solid var(--line);padding:32px;background:#0b1015;border-radius:18px}.integration-section h2{font-size:30px;max-width:720px}.integration-section>p:not(.eyebrow):not(.micro){max-width:850px;color:#b8bcbf}.tool-list{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:22px 0}.tool-list span{border:1px solid #34414d;border-radius:8px;padding:8px 13px;font-size:13px;color:#cedce7}.solution-options label:last-child{grid-column:1/-1}
 @media(max-width:1000px){.accounting-hero{gap:30px}.workflow-preview{padding:22px}.preview-top{display:block}.preview-label{display:block;margin-top:-10px;margin-bottom:16px}}
 @media(max-width:760px){.accounting-hero{grid-template-columns:1fr}.accounting-hero h1{font-size:clamp(38px,8.5vw,52px)}.workflow-preview{max-width:520px;width:100%}.fit-strip{gap:12px;flex-direction:column}.integration-section{padding:25px}.integration-section h2{font-size:26px}}
</style>
